{"last_link_id": 22, "nodes": [{"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "aligner", "links": [14], "label": "aligner", "type": "QWEN3_ALIGNER", "localized_name": "aligner"}], "size": [337.7712097167969, 82], "pos": [-243.21762084960938, -124.76818084716797], "widgets_values": ["Qwen3-ForcedAligner-0.6B", false], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "model_name"}, "name": "model_name", "label": "model_name", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "model_name"}, {"widget": {"name": "unload_after"}, "shape": 7, "name": "unload_after", "label": "unload_after", "type": "BOOLEAN", "localized_name": "unload_after"}], "flags": {}, "id": 16, "type": "Qwen3ForcedAlignerLoader", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {"model_name": true}, "Node name for S&R": "Qwen3ForcedAlignerLoader"}, "order": 0}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"shape": 6, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "size": [279.9638977050781, 333.4961853027344], "pos": [531.2479858398438, -84.90337371826172], "widgets_values": ["我叫陈明\t0.480\t1.200\n因为庄大运来到这个平行世界\t1.440\t3.200\n好在及时觉醒了系统\t3.920\t5.520\n穿越后保住一命\t5.840\t6.800\n可代价却是我反手欠了系统整整一百个亿\t7.920\t12.720\n嗯啊啊啊\t17.440\t21.520\n系统\t28.720\t29.600\n你除了讨债就没有别的能力了吗\t29.760\t33.040\n啊啊啊\t36.000\t36.000\n只要得到足够的打赏还账\t43.440\t45.120\n就不用变植物人了\t45.440\t46.560\n要是运气好\t47.120\t48.000\n能多赚几笔\t48.080\t48.960\n还能彻底翻身\t49.040\t50.320\n好好享受人生\t50.400\t51.680\n不过想要赚足打赏\t52.560\t54.080\n最直接的路子就是从皇帝那薅钱\t54.240\t56.960\n可怎么才能让皇帝心甘情愿的打赏\t57.520\t59.840\n溜须拍马\t60.160\t60.880\n吹捧他们的功绩\t60.880\t61.600\n不行不行\t62.240\t62.720\n哎对了\t63.200\t63.680\n古代奸臣多的是\t64.080\t65.200\n我帮皇帝揪出这些蛀虫\t65.600\t67.120\n他们不得乖乖给我打赏\t67.360\t68.800\n嗯\t69.360\t69.920\n合理\t70.000\t70.400\n太合理了\t70.640\t71.360\n不知道这些自命不凡的帝王\t71.840\t73.840\n看到朝中蛀虫\t73.840\t74.960\n会是什么反应呢\t75.280\t76.400\n各位帝王们\t77.200\t78.080\n你们准备好了吗\t78.480\t79.600\n投放\t80.160\t80.880"], "inputs": [{"name": "text", "link": 17, "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "id": 17, "type": "ShowText|pysssss", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfyui-custom-scripts", "ver": "f2838ed5e59de4d73cde5c98354b87a8d3200190", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "ShowText|pysssss"}, "order": 3}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"shape": 6, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "size": [279.9638977050781, 333.4961853027344], "pos": [864.3303833007812, -92.59820556640625], "widgets_values": ["我叫陈明\n因为庄大运来到这个平行世界\n好在及时觉醒了系统\n穿越后保住一命\n可代价却是我反手欠了系统整整一百个亿\n嗯啊啊啊\n系统\n你除了讨债就没有别的能力了吗\n啊啊啊\n只要得到足够的打赏还账\n就不用变植物人了\n要是运气好\n能多赚几笔\n还能彻底翻身\n好好享受人生\n不过想要赚足打赏\n最直接的路子就是从皇帝那薅钱\n可怎么才能让皇帝心甘情愿的打赏\n溜须拍马\n吹捧他们的功绩\n不行不行\n哎对了\n古代奸臣多的是\n我帮皇帝揪出这些蛀虫\n他们不得乖乖给我打赏\n嗯\n合理\n太合理了\n不知道这些自命不凡的帝王\n看到朝中蛀虫\n会是什么反应呢\n各位帝王们\n你们准备好了吗\n投放"], "inputs": [{"name": "text", "link": 19, "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "id": 19, "type": "ShowText|pysssss", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfyui-custom-scripts", "ver": "f2838ed5e59de4d73cde5c98354b87a8d3200190", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "ShowText|pysssss"}, "order": 5}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"shape": 6, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "size": [279.9638977050781, 333.4961853027344], "pos": [535.01171875, 315.83001708984375], "widgets_values": ["0.480\n1.440\n3.920\n5.840\n7.920\n17.440\n28.720\n29.760\n36.000\n43.440\n45.440\n47.120\n48.080\n49.040\n50.400\n52.560\n54.240\n57.520\n60.160\n60.880\n62.240\n63.200\n64.080\n65.600\n67.360\n69.360\n70.000\n70.640\n71.840\n73.840\n75.280\n77.200\n78.480\n80.160"], "inputs": [{"name": "text", "link": 20, "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "id": 20, "type": "ShowText|pysssss", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfyui-custom-scripts", "ver": "f2838ed5e59de4d73cde5c98354b87a8d3200190", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "ShowText|pysssss"}, "order": 6}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"shape": 6, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type"